#* {{quote-journal
|en
|date=May 24, 2012
|author=Adam Gabbatt
|title=Canada student protests erupt into political crisis with mass arrests
|work=the Guardian
|url=http://www.guardian.co.uk/world/2012/may/24/canada-student-fee-protest-arrests?INTCMP=SRCH
|page=
