# {{lb|en|transitive|obsolete}} To [[deny]] the [[truth]] of something.
#: {{syn|en|contradict|controvert|dispute|gainsay}}
#* '''1653''', {{w|John Austin (1613–69)|William Birchley}}, ''The Christian Moderator, Part 3,'' London: Richard Lowndes, p.{{nbsp}}7,<sup>[http://name.umdl.umich.edu/A75812.0001.001]</sup>
