#* '''1803''', {{w|Robert Charles Dallas}}, ''The History of the Maroons'', London: Longman and Rees, Volume 1, Letter{{nbsp}}6, p.{{nbsp}}168,<sup>[https://archive.org/details/cihm_44228/page/n315]</sup>
